Feature: Dashboard Personalization
Description

Allow users to customize their dashboard so they see the information that is most relevant to them instead of a fixed layout.

Business Value

As a user, I want my dashboard to highlight the goals and information that matter most to me, helping me focus on my priorities without feeling overwhelmed.

Planned Features
Choose default dashboard layout.
Show highest priority goals.
Show most recently updated goals.
Show goals with the nearest deadlines.
Continue where the user last stopped.
Pin favorite goals to the dashboard.
Filter goals by category.
Hide completed goals.
Customize dashboard widgets.

# version 1.3

Instead of always showing a static greeting:

"Good afternoon, Lukas."

The application could ask something dynamic, for example:

What would you like to improve today?
Which goal deserves your attention today?
You have 15 minutes available. Which goal should we work on?
Your highest-priority goal hasn't been updated in 5 days.
You're only 10% away from completing your React course!

This turns the dashboard from a passive screen into an active assistant